## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or inspect deployment:
```bash
kubectl get deployment api-service
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME          READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
api-service   4/4     4            4           5m
```
All 4 replicas must show `READY 4/4`, `UP-TO-DATE 4`, and status `Running` with zero unready pods.
